{"meta":{"ui":"order_summary","model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","form":"notation","designSystem":"cards","turn":"generate","prompt":"Show my grocery order as an inline card before you place it: five line items with a picture placeholder, price and a quantity I can raise or lower (removing at zero), a promo code field that takes SAVE10, the subtotal, delivery and total kept up to date, and confirm and cancel buttons that tell you what I decided.","text":"ChatCard \"Your grocery order\" \"Review before placing\" icon:\"shopping_basket\" status:\"Draft\" tone:accent w:390\n  state items=[{\"id\":1,\"name\":\"Bananas\",\"detail\":\"1 bunch\",\"price\":2.49,\"qty\":1,\"kind\":\"banana\",\"tone\":\"sand\"},{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"Whole milk\",\"detail\":\"2 L\",\"price\":3.29,\"qty\":2,\"kind\":\"milk\",\"tone\":\"sky\"},{\"id\":3,\"name\":\"Sourdough bread\",\"detail\":\"1 loaf\",\"price\":4.5,\"qty\":1,\"kind\":\"bread\",\"tone\":\"sand\"},{\"id\":4,\"name\":\"Free-range eggs\",\"detail\":\"12 pack\",\"price\":5.2,\"qty\":1,\"kind\":\"eggs\",\"tone\":\"rose\"},{\"id\":5,\"name\":\"Cheddar cheese\",\"detail\":\"250 g\",\"price\":4.99,\"qty\":1,\"kind\":\"cheese\",\"tone\":\"mint\"}]\n  state promo=\"\"\n  state decision=\"\"\n  if decision==\"\"\n    SectionLabel \"Items\" \"{length(items)} products\"\n    each i in items\n      CartLine \"{i.name}\" \"{i.detail}\" price:=money(i.price*i.qty,\"$\",2) qty:=i.qty kind:=i.kind tone:=i.tone -> items=result==0?removeWhere(items,x=>x.id==i.id):updateWhere(items,x=>x.id==i.id,x=>with(x,\"qty\",result))\n    InputField \"Promo code\" \"Try SAVE10\" =promo success:=upper(trim(promo))==\"SAVE10\"?\"SAVE10 applied: 10% off\":\"\" error:=promo!=\"\"&&upper(trim(promo))!=\"SAVE10\"?\"Code not recognised\":\"\"\n    Details rows:=[[\"Subtotal\",money(sum(items,x=>x.price*x.qty),\"$\",2)],[\"Discount\",upper(trim(promo))==\"SAVE10\"?\"-\"+money(sum(items,x=>x.price*x.qty)*0.1,\"$\",2):\"\"],[\"Delivery\",sum(items,x=>x.qty)==0?\"$0.00\":\"$4.99